# Constraints inferred while drawing arcs and circles (an extension,
# roadmap 29.4): a line, then an arc from its end with the chord square
# to it, which is made tangent to the line; a circle, then another
# nearly as big, which is made the same size. The mouse moves twice to
# each point, as a drag does.
key s
move 200 200
down L 200 200
up L 200 200
move 300 200
move 300 200
down L 300 200
up L 300 200
key esc
key a
move 300 200
down L 300 200
up L 300 200
move 300 259
move 300 260
down L 300 260
up L 300 260
key esc
key c
move 450 200
down L 450 200
up L 450 200
move 490 200
move 490 200
down L 490 200
up L 490 200
key esc
key c
move 450 350
down L 450 350
up L 450 350
move 490 349
move 490 351
down L 490 351
up L 490 351
key esc
save
